  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "fc_doc",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -404
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "FACE CONSTELLATION\n\nSwitch the Camera on and look into it. Your face turns into a patch of night sky: a scatter of twinkling stars joined by fine threads, with your eyes, irises, lips and the outline of your face picked out in light.\n\nOpen your mouth wide and the threads reach further and the whole face glows brighter. Turn and tilt your head and the stars follow.\n\nHow it works: the face tracker gives 478 points. Stars picks every third one and makes it twinkle on its own beat, Connect Points joins near neighbours, Face lines traces the eyes, lips and outline, and Mouth sensor measures how wide your mouth is open compared with your face.\n\nMake it yours: double-click Stars to change the five star colours or how many there are, or change how far the threads reach when your mouth is shut.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 340
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "FACE CONSTELLATION\n\nSwitch the Camera on and look into it. Your face turns into a patch of night sky: a scatter of twinkling stars joined by fine threads, with your eyes, irises, lips and the outline of your face picked out in light.\n\nOpen your mouth wide and the threads reach further and the whole face glows brighter. Turn and tilt your head and the stars follow.\n\nHow it works: the face tracker gives 478 points. Stars picks every third one and makes it twinkle on its own beat, Connect Points joins near neighbours, Face lines traces the eyes, lips and outline, and Mouth sensor measures how wide your mouth is open compared with your face.\n\nMake it yours: double-click Stars to change the five star colours or how many there are, or change how far the threads reach when your mouth is shut.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 340
      }
    },
